### Place BUY order
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"traderId": "{{traderId}}","stock":"NVDA","sector":"TECH","quantity":50,"side":"BUY"}

### Fill an Order
POST {{host}}/api/traders/{{traderId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/fill
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### Cancels an Order
POST {{host}}/api/traders/{{traderId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel

### Portfolio
GET {{host}}/api/traders/{{traderId}}/portfolio

### Sector overlap
GET {{host}}/api/traders/{{traderId}}/sector-overlap


### Add starting holdings
POST {{host}}/api/traders/{{traderId}}/portfolio/holdings
Content-Type: application/json

{"stock":"AAPL","sector":"TECH","quantity":100}